-		"details": "When your [CSP](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/configuration#csp) enforces Trusted Types with `'require-trusted-types-for': ['script']`, SvelteKit registers your service worker through a Trusted Types policy called `sveltekit-trusted-url`. Add it to the allowed policies:

```js
csp: {
	directives: {
		'require-trusted-types-for': ['script'],
		'trusted-types': ['sveltekit-trusted-url']
	}
}
```

Alternatively, set [`serviceWorker.register`](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/configuration#serviceWorker) to `false` and register the service worker yourself."

