-		"details": "CSRF protection is always enabled in SvelteKit 3. Instead of disabling it with `checkOrigin: false`, list the external origins that are allowed to submit forms to your app in [`csrf.trustedOrigins`](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/configuration#csrf):

```js
csrf: {
	trustedOrigins: ['https://payment-gateway.com'];
}
```"

