-		"details": "While [prerendering](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/page-options#prerender), SvelteKit requested this path — because it was listed in [`prerender.entries`](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/configuration#prerender), returned from an [`entries`](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/page-options#entries) function, linked from a prerendered page or fetched during its `load` — and received an error response, which is logged above. When the path was reached from another page, the message says which one.

Fix the link or request, or the error in the route. If the failure is expected, handle it with [`prerender.handleHttpError`](https://svelte.dev/docs/kit/configuration#prerender):

```js
sveltekit({
	prerender: {
		handleHttpError: ({ path, referrer, message }) => {
			// ignore deliberate link to shiny 404 page
			if (path === '/not-found' && referrer === '/blog/how-we-built-our-404-page') {
				return;
			}

			// otherwise fail the build
			throw new Error(message);
		}
	}
});
```"

